/* MvNumberedList — numbered guidance rows ("Dicas de convivência").
 * Spec: DESIGN_IMPLEMENTATION.md §6 row 7, §8.3 "Tips section".
 * Figma: `Tips Container Card` 15:609 — rows H, gap 12, row gap 16;
 * marker 24x24 primary circle with a 12px 700 on-primary number;
 * body 14px 400 on-surface-variant.
 *
 * NOTE: no hex literals anywhere in this file, comments included —
 * TokenDisciplineTests.ComponentUss_HasNoHardcodedColors scans the raw text.
 *
 * WHY THE MARKER IS A BOX WITH A LABEL IN IT, NOT A STYLED LABEL
 *   A 24x24 Label with a centered glyph would be clipped: TextCore's line box for
 *   a 12px face is taller than the glyph but shorter than 24dp, and vertical
 *   centering inside a fixed-height text element is `-unity-text-align`, which
 *   fights `overflow: hidden` on the circle. A flex box that centers a free-sized
 *   Label is stable at any digit count (1, 10, 100 all stay centered).
 *
 * BODY COLOR
 *   V2's tip text is the "body grey", which Appendix A.1 collapses onto
 *   `on-surface-variant` (the same role as the caption grey). That collapse is the
 *   documented decision, not an approximation made here.
 */

.mv-numbered-list {
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: stretch;
}

.mv-numbered-list__item {
    flex-direction: row;
    align-items: flex-start;
    margin-top: 16px;
}

.mv-numbered-list__item--first {
    margin-top: 0;
}

.mv-numbered-list__marker {
    width: 24px;
    height: 24px;
    flex-shrink: 0;
    margin-right: 12px;
    border-radius: var(--md-sys-shape-corner-full);
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    background-color: var(--md-sys-color-primary);
}

.mv-numbered-list__number {
    margin: 0;
    padding: 0;
    font-size: 12px;
    letter-spacing: 0;
    -unity-text-align: middle-center;
    -unity-font-definition: url("/Assets/DesignSystem/Fonts/Inter-Bold.asset");
    color: var(--md-sys-color-on-primary);
}

/* body-large metrics (14px / ls 0), 400 face, wrapping. `flex-shrink: 1` plus
 * `flex-grow: 1` is what makes a long tip wrap inside the card instead of
 * pushing the marker off the row. */
.mv-numbered-list__text {
    margin: 0;
    padding: 0;
    flex-grow: 1;
    flex-shrink: 1;
    font-size: 14px;
    letter-spacing: 0;
    white-space: normal;
    -unity-font-definition: url("/Assets/DesignSystem/Fonts/Inter-Regular.asset");
    color: var(--md-sys-color-on-surface-variant);
}
